      "title": {
        "en": "Caring doctors alongside critical service complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners commend the veterinarians and support staff for their warmth, compassion, and attentive bedside manner during visits. However, a notable number of reviewers report sharply negative interactions, citing instances of perceived coldness, raised voices, or dismissive communication when concerns arose."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive pet handling with handling concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous clients appreciate the affectionate and patient approach shown to their dogs and cats, describing staff who comfort nervous pets during exams and surgeries. Conversely, several dissatisfied owners reported harsh handling techniques, such as scruffing senior cats, or expressed concern regarding unmonitored overnight care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Lifesaving interventions mixed with severe losses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A substantial number of pet parents credit the clinic with successful surgical outcomes and timely treatment of complex conditions, noting instances where pets recovered fully. At the same time, several critical reviews recount sudden patient deterioration, disputed diagnostic interpretations, and unexpected pet fatalities."
      }
    }
  ],
